<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/office-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/office-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/office-building.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="678" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Legal</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lede">How we collect, use and protect the information you share with us.</p></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<p><em>Last updated: November 12, 2026</em></p>
<h2>What we collect</h2><p>When you send a form, call or email us, we collect the information you choose to give — such as your name, phone number, email address, property location and details about your claim. Our web host also records standard technical data (IP address, browser type, pages requested) for security and performance.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><ul><li>To respond to your inquiry and evaluate your claim.</li><li>To provide services you request.</li><li>To keep the site secure and working.</li></ul>
<p>We don’t sell your personal information. We share it only with people who need it to help with your claim (with your permission), with service providers who host our site and email, or when required by law.</p>
<h2>Claim worksheets</h2><p>Our calculators and checklists run in your browser. The numbers you enter aren’t sent to us or stored on our servers.</p>
<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This site doesn’t use advertising cookies. We may use a tag manager and analytics to understand how visitors use the site. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which may log standard request data under Google’s privacy policy.</p>
<h2>Text messages</h2><p>If you agree to be contacted by text, message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out at any time.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information you’ve given us by emailing <a href="mailto:info@delawareinsuranceappraiser.com">info@delawareinsuranceappraiser.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Delaware Insurance Appraiser · <a href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a> · <a href="mailto:info@delawareinsuranceappraiser.com">info@delawareinsuranceappraiser.com</a></p></article><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sticky"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through, free</h2><p>A short call tells you whether appraisal fits your claim — and if it doesn’t, what will.</p><a class="side-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-coral" href="/start-your-review/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm ET</small></div></div></aside></div>
